    key_fact: "The dedup machinery ALREADY EXISTS and WORKS — fingerprint + dup_count columns,
           120 rows use them, one absorbed 211 duplicates. 2487 rows carry fingerprint=NULL.
           Wire into it (R9), do not build a second mechanism."
    hardest_part: "phase_2 auto-close. Closing a condition because it stopped being re-emitted
           is WRONG — a dead emitter produces identical silence, and that rule would have
           reported the 12-day C1 outage as '6 problems resolved themselves'. Close only on a
           cycle MANIFEST from a demonstrably-live emitter. Acceptance B1 tests exactly this:
           stop the emitter for 3 cycles and assert ZERO auto-closes."
    invariant: "SUM(dup_count) + closed-with-evidence == 2587. Nothing suppressed, everything
           counted. A low pending count reached any other way is a FAILURE of the spec."
    gate: "phase_0 diagnose is MANDATORY before code. It includes diffing the DEPLOYED
           vsf_s5_ledger.py against the repo copy — a 3-month-stale repo copy is what caused
           [O]'s bad C1 subject fix on 2026-07-24. If they differ, STOP and report."
  }

